# Final Launch Gap Check

Before marking a real project ready for launch, demo, client handoff, or production payment/user-data flows, review commonly missed gaps.

## Check These Areas

- Authorization negative tests and IDOR risks
- Backup, restore, migration rollback, and deploy rollback plan
- Email deliverability and failed-email visibility
- Admin audit logging for sensitive actions
- Privacy, child/minor data, data retention, and deletion policy
- Timezone, date, and money correctness
- Accessibility, keyboard use, and reduced-motion support
- Mobile and browser test matrix
- Environment separation: dev/staging/prod, test/live payments, webhook secrets
- Legal/policy placeholders: privacy, cookie, terms, refund where relevant

