## Agent Instructions

- Add or update docs and checklists if missing.
- Prefer documentation and test plans over overbuilding infrastructure.
- Implement only low-risk obvious fixes unless the project clearly needs more.
- Never claim launch-ready without reviewing `docs/project/FINAL_LAUNCH_REVIEW.md`.
- Scale rigor to project scope — a simple brochure site needs fewer checks than an app with accounts, payments, or private data.
